title: "FMWF-Reproduction: Tor Five-Tab Few-Shot Website Fingerprinting"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "FMWF Reproduction contributors"
abstract: "Metric-matched, broadly configuration-matched Tor closed-world reproduction of FMWF, with 25-shot and 40-shot final epoch-300 results and explicitly provisional, overlapping validation files."
